---
My mother taught me to begin with the stock. Keep the order and it never fails.

## Ingredients (serves two)

1. 2 cups anchovy stock
2. 1.5 tablespoons miso paste
3. Half a zucchini, half a block of tofu, half an onion
4. One green chili

## Method

Dissolve the miso in the stock, add the firm vegetables first, tofu last, and take it off the heat after one boil.

> Tip: strain the miso through a sieve for a much cleaner broth.

### Good on the side

- Freshly cooked rice
- A rolled omelette
- A small plate of kimchi
